      "date": "2026-05-21T12:44:02.000Z",
      "title": "Dividend of ₹11.00 announced",
      "body": "Dividend of ₹11.00 is the same as last year. Ex-date: 31st July 2026 Payment date: 17th September 2026 Dividend yield will be 0.2%, which is lower than the industry average of 0.8%. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is well covered by both earnings (8% earnings payout ratio) and cash flows (12% cash payout ratio). The dividend has increased by an average of 5.8% per year over the past 8 years. However, payments have been volatile during that time. EPS is expected to grow by 41% over the next 3 years, which should provide support to the dividend and adequate earnings cover.",
